{"Delete query's retryCount branch has no method filter - the second OR branch {retryCount: {gt: 1}} matches WorkflowReminders of ANY method (EMAIL, WHATSAPP, SMS), so the SMS cron job could delete reminders belonging to other channels. Need to add method: WorkflowMethods.SMS to the retryCount branch": 0.9963175058364868, "Prisma update in catch block is unguarded - if prisma.workflowReminder.update throws (e.g., DB connection issue), the error propagates out of the for-loop, skipping all remaining unscheduled reminders in this cron run": 0.9502119421958923, "Catch block increments retryCount even when SMS was successfully sent to Twilio - if scheduledSMS is truthy but the subsequent prisma update throws, the catch block increments retryCount. The SMS is already scheduled with Twilio but the DB still shows scheduled: false, potentially causing duplicate sends on next cron run": 0.8284652233123779}